### 1. Place a BUY order
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "traderId": "T001", "stock": "AAPL", "sector": "TECH", "quantity": 150, "side": "BUY" }

### 2. Fill it
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/1/fill

### 3. Cancelling a FILLED order -> 409 INVALID_ORDER_STATE
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders/1/cancel

### 6. Add holdings directly
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/traders/T001/portfolio/holdings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stock": "TSLA", "sector": "TECH", "quantity": 80 }

### 4. Portfolio -> positions AAPL 150, TSLA 80; TECH 230
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/traders/T001/portfolio

### 6. Add NVDA so the portfolio matches the worked example
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/traders/T001/portfolio/holdings
Content-Type: application/json

{ "stock": "NVDA", "sector": "TECH", "quantity": 100 }

### 5. Overlap -> TECH_HEAVY 75.00%, FINANCE_HEAVY 0.00%, BALANCED 50.00%, HIGH
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/traders/T001/portfolio/overlap

### SELL more than held -> 422 INSUFFICIENT_HOLDINGS
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{ "traderId": "T001", "stock": "AAPL", "sector": "TECH", "quantity": 500, "side": "SELL" }
